# The VPU's encoder belongs to rk-vepu-h264 (board/oga/linux/rk-vepu-h264):
# H.264 for the stream. Hantro would take the same node for its JPEG encoder
# and the decoders, which nothing here uses.
# CONFIG_VIDEO_HANTRO is not set
